9010 0 obj
  << /ActualText (A single attacker transaction on the mainnet is enough to permanently stall the engine\220s fold for every tenant\056\nThe attacker deploys a small contract on the blockchain with a function that recurses through nested calls to at least depth 64\054 it can be a self\055calling function\056 The call is included in some block N\056 The transaction requires no privilege or authentication\054 and does not even need to succeed\072 the callTracer records reverted call trees too\054 so a failing or self\055reverting contract poisons the block just as well as a successful one\056\nThe heartbeat loop drives fold\072\072advance\050ctx\054 \046mut tenant\137states\054 \046mut cursor\054 safe\137head\051\054 which walks blocks from the committed cursor toward the trusted frontier\056 When it arrives at block N it executes the per\055height fetch\072)
     /K [ 11 ]
     /P 9011 0 R
     /Pg 2843 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
endobj

