  << /ActualText (Increasing preVerificationGas increases the amount charged to the paymaster without requiring equivalent additional execution\056\nA similar overcharge is possible through paymasterPostOpGasLimit\054 which reserves gas for the paymaster\220s post\055execution callback\056 AnafiPaymaster returns an empty context\054 so EntryPoint skips this callback\056 However\054 the EntryPoint still includes its gas limit when calculating the 10\045 unused\055gas penalty\056 Raising this limit therefore increases the payment to the beneficiary even though the callback is never executed\056)
     /K [ 0 ]
     /P 9164 0 R
     /Pg 7459 0 R
     /S /Span
     /Type /StructElem
  >>
